0..68 Comment "/// This source compares two allocation orders for one linked arena."
69..72 Comment "///"
73..131 Comment "/// A relabelling connects the id types of the two orders."
132..186 Comment "/// It carries each link and label to the other arena."
187..190 Comment "///"
191..257 Comment "/// The checker proves that both arenas and their consumers agree."
258..308 Comment "/// A bare id remains valid only in its own arena."
